azy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"776\" height=\"389\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":162,"commentCount":38,"created":1668063671,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1574053804840005632"},{"id":"1573323521559855104","title":"我在想一个问题: 我要不要把文字风格给提…","content":"<p>我在想一个问题:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我要不要把文字风格给提高一些密度，就是看上去文字厚度会深一点的那种。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;我现在的思路是写的简单，直白，你们看着的感觉是像看初中或者高中写的感觉。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;还是要把文字写的厚重些，弄些专业名词显得文字有底蕴厚度呢？</p>","excerpt":"我在想一个问题: 我要不要把文字风格给提…","voteupCount":92,"commentCount":44,"created":1667889558,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1573323521559855104"},{"id":"1573254699163222016","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-5f6f5835bc929cc5680b8dbea9033fad_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1420\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":151,"commentCount":18,"created":1667873149,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1573254699163222016"},{"id":"1572969488139595776","title":"明天写成人礼吧，知乎是发不出来了","content":"<p>明天写成人礼吧，知乎是发不出来了。</p>","excerpt":"明天写成人礼吧，知乎是发不出来了","voteupCount":121,"commentCount":17,"created":1667805150,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1572969488139595776"},{"id":"1572895120214691840","title":"你女儿过生日，我爷爷就饿死","content":"<p>你女儿过生日，我爷爷就饿死。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2022年最佳考公文案</p>","excerpt":"你女儿过生日，我爷爷就饿死","voteupCount":289,"commentCount":9,"created":1667787419,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1572895120214691840"}]}